    "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;padding:15px;background:#f5f5f5;border-bottom:3px solid #333\">\n  <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 5px;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold\">Standard Goal Tracking</h2>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#666\">Month / Year: <span style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#000\">Track progress on independence goals</span></p>\n</div>",
