    "defaultValue": "",
    "choices": "",
    "conditionalLogic": "",
    "content": "<div class=\"gform-instructions\">\n  <h2>How to Complete This Form</h2>\n  <p>This form tracks an individual's progress on independence goals throughout the month. Complete one form per goal, per month.</p>\n\n  <details open>\n    <summary><strong>Step 1: Enter Basic Information</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Client Name:</strong> Enter the full name of the individual whose goal is being tracked.</li>\n      <li><strong>Goal:</strong> Write the specific independence goal being worked on (e.g., \"Increase independent living skills focused on meal preparation\").</li>\n      <li><strong>Effective Date:</strong> Enter the date this goal became active.</li>\n      <li><strong>Month / Year:</strong> Enter the month and year you are tracking (e.g., \"December 2025\").</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 2: Track Weekly Progress (4 Sections)</strong></summary>\n    <p>The form is divided into 4 weekly tracking periods. For each period, record:</p>\n    \n    <h3>For Each Week:</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong># of times individual worked on the goal:</strong> Enter the number of times during that week period. Must be 1 or more times per week.</li>\n      <li><strong># of times provider supported individual:</strong> Enter how many times you provided support to help increase their independence related to this goal.</li>\n      <li><strong>Type of support provided:</strong> Check all that apply:\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>Verbal</strong> - Verbal prompts, encouragement, or instructions</li>\n          <li><strong>Supervision</strong> - Watching and monitoring the individual</li>\n          <li><strong>Physical Assistance</strong> - Hands-on help with the task</li>\n          <li><strong>Other</strong> - Specify any other type of support</li>\n        </ul>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    \n    <h3>The Four Weekly Periods:</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Days 1-7</strong> (First week)</li>\n      <li><strong>Days 8-14</strong> (Second week)</li>\n      <li><strong>Days 15-21</strong> (Third week)</li>\n      <li><strong>Days 22-31</strong> (Fourth week/end of month)</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 3: Assess Goal Continuation</strong></summary>\n    <p>At the end of the tracking period, evaluate whether to continue this goal:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Does the individual still express interest?</strong> Select Yes or No.</li>\n      <li><strong>If No:</strong> Describe what new goal the individual wants to work on.</li>\n      <li><strong>What would be needed:</strong> List resources, training, or support needed to implement the new goal.</li>\n      <li><strong>Provider able to assist?</strong> Indicate if you can help with the new goal.</li>\n      <li><strong>If not able:</strong> Explain why you cannot assist with achieving the new goal.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary><strong>Step 4: Add Comments and Sign</strong></summary>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>Additional Comments / Notes:</strong> Add any relevant observations, progress notes, barriers encountered, or successes achieved.</li>\n      <li><strong>Provider Signature:</strong> Enter your name to certify this information.</li>\n      <li><strong>Date:</strong> Select the date you completed this form.</li>\n      <li>Click <strong>Submit</strong> to finalize the form.</li>\n    </ol>\n  </details>\n</div>",
